  <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="http://www.aist.go.jp/">HOME</a><span>&#160;&gt;&#160;</span><a href="http://www.aist.go.jp/aist_e/about_aist/organization/index.html">Organization</a><span>&#160;&gt;&#160;</span><a href="../../index_en.html">Intelligent Systems Research Institute</a><span>&#160;&gt;&#160;</span>Research Groups</p>
